    title: 'Gym & Fitness Studio Branding in Dubai: Standing Out in a Crowded Wellness Market',
    excerpt: 'Dubai\'s health and wellness scene is booming, which means every new gym or studio is fighting harder for attention. Here is what actually makes a fitness brand stick.',
