    title: 'Law Firm & Consultancy Website Design in Dubai: Building Credibility Before the First Call',
    excerpt: 'Legal and consultancy clients research extensively before they ever pick up the phone. Here is what a law firm or consultancy website in Dubai needs to get right.',
